[00:25.92]1. On many occasions God spoke to men
[00:30.92]By means of his prophets of old.
[00:39.92]Today he is saying, ‘Let all repent,’
[00:42.92]By God’s own Son we are told.
[00:46.39](Chorus)
[00:49.87]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[00:54.35]We must build such faith to survive.
[01:00.35]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[01:06.03]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
[01:21.60]2. We gladly obey Christ Jesus’ command
[01:27.60]To share Kingdom truth far and wide.
[01:32.60]We boldly declare God’s message of hope;
[01:39.60]His promise we’ll never hide.
[01:42.55](Chorus)
[01:45.50]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[01:51.50]We must build such faith to survive.
[01:57.50]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[02:03.50]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
[02:29.56]3. Our faith is an anchor firm and secure;
[02:36.56]We never will shrink back in fear.
[02:41.56]Our trust in Jehovah helps us endure;
[02:48.56]We know salvation is near.
[02:51.90](Chorus)
[02:55.24]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[03:00.24]We must build such faith to survive.
[03:06.24]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[03:12.24]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.